        "description": "One ``{{ placeholder }}`` of a .docx template with operator metadata.\n\nA fresh scan yields ``label = name`` / ``kind = text`` / ``required = True``;\nthe operator refines label/hint/kind by hand (they drive the questions the\nagent asks).",
